  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Casting class feature or ability to gain martial focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you successfully outwit a creature by tricking it when it has a disorientation condition, by embarrassing it when it has the impressed condition, or when using a special outwit option granted by an ability you possess, you may spend a spell point or martial focus instead of the cost to outwit, allowing you to outwit the creature one additional time. A creature cannot be outwitted by this ability more than once every 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
